OL,3,GNEWSAIlluminated signage for gaming
OL,4,Acentre approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial plans to install
OL,7,Filluminated signage outside a 24-hour
OL,8,Fadult gaming centre in Whitby have been
OL,9,Fapproved despite objections.
OL,11,FA halo-illuminated fascia sign and an
OL,12,Fexternally illuminated hanging sign
OL,13,Fwill be installed at the former Halifax
OL,14,Fbranch on Baxtergate after revised
OL,15,Fplans submitted by Luxury Leisure were
OL,16,Fapproved by North Yorkshire Council.
OL,18,FThe site is being converted into a
OL,19,Fgaming centre as part of plans by the
OL,20,Fcompany, which trades as Admiral.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
