OL,3,GNEWSAIlluminated signage for gaming
OL,4,Acentre approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Whitby Civic Society had been among
OL,7,Fthose to object to the plans, but
OL,8,Fcouncil officers said the revised
OL,9,Fdesign was "much more subtle" than the
OL,10,Fpreviously refused scheme.
